    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF3 \u2014 Operational governance log (25 columns)\n\nERROR HANDLING:\n- All nodes: continueRegularOutput (WF3 never crashes silently)\n- Google Sheets Write: 3 retries with backoff\n- If Sheets write fails after retries, n8n execution log captures the failure\n\nQA COLUMNS (written every run):\n- qa_severity_valid: PASS / FAIL\n- qa_title_length: PASS / WARN\n- qa_postmortem_length: PASS / WARN\n- qa_all_fields_present: PASS / FAIL\n- overall_qa_status: QA PASSED / QA WARNED / QA FAILED\n\nIDENTITY: run_id | execution_timestamp | original_run_timestamp\nINCIDENT: incident_id | severity\nMODEL GOVERNANCE: model_used | fallback_triggered\nHUMAN GOVERNANCE: approval_decision | human_reviewed\nOUTCOME: processing_status | overall_run_health | escalation_required\nSTEP AUDIT: doc_created | email_sent | sheet_updated\nARIA SNAPSHOT: root_cause_logged | recommended_action_logged\nQA: qa_severity_valid | qa_title_length | qa_postmortem_length | qa_all_fields_present | overall_qa_status\nERROR: error_reason\nSYSTEM: pipeline_stage_reached | workflow_version\n\nRUN LOGS TAB \u2014 25 HEADERS (copy exactly):\nrun_id | execution_timestamp | original_run_timestamp | incident_id |\nseverity | model_used | fallback_triggered | processing_status |\noverall_run_health | escalation_required | approval_decision |\nhuman_reviewed | doc_created | email_sent | sheet_updated |\nroot_cause_logged | recommended_action_logged |\nqa_severity_valid | qa_title_length | qa_postmortem_length |\nqa_all_fields_present | overall_qa_status |\nerror_reason | pipeline_stage_reached | workflow_version"
      },
